                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Fabelia's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Everyday accessible + trend-driven + Instagram-first + multi-channel positioning. Different from traditional gold / diamond incumbents.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new jewelry brands compete with Fabelia?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in category niching (luxury silver, specific ethnic-adjacent, sustainability-focused). Category has room for multiple positioning.</p>
                                        <h3>Should new jewelry brands focus everyday or occasion?</h3>
                                        <p>Depends. Everyday = higher purchase frequency + lower AOV. Occasion = higher AOV + lower frequency. Portfolio approach often combines both.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest accessible jewelry lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Design-first + Instagram-first + multi-channel + occasion-marketing combined. Not traditional jewelry playbook.</p>
